','Woocommerce already installed and activated'=>'Woocommerce 已安装并激活','Woocommerce need to install and active'=>'Woocommerce 需要安装并激活','Woocommerce already install , please activate it'=>'Woocommerce 已安装，请激活它','Install & Active Now'=>'立即安装并激活','Active Now'=>'现在活跃','General settings'=>'常规设置','Choose some general option.'=>'选择一些常规选项。','Events Label:'=>'活动标签：','It will change the Events post type label on the entire plugin.'=>'它将更改整个插件上的事件帖子类型标签。','Events Slug:'=>'活动片段：','Changing this will update the Events slug across the plugin. After that, go to Settings → Permalinks and click Save to refresh links.'=>'更改此设置将更新插件中的事件 slug。之后，转到“设置”→“永久链接”并单击“保存”以刷新链接。','When will the event expire'=>'活动什么时候结束','Event Start Time'=>'活动开始时间','Event End Time'=>'活动结束时间','Please select when the event will expire'=>'请选择活动何时到期','Email From Name:'=>'电子邮件发件人姓名：','Please enter the email from name'=>'请输入姓名中的电子邮件','From Email Address:'=>'来自电子邮件地址：','Finalize Setup'=>'完成设置','You are about to Finish & Save Events Booking Manager For Woocommerce Plugin setup process'=>'您即将完成并保存 Woocommerce 插件的活动预订管理器设置过程','Finish & Save'=>'完成并保存','Total RSVPs'=>'回复总数','Checked In'=>'已签到','Bulk Actions'=>'批量操作','Mark Checked In'=>'标记已签入','Mark Not Checked In'=>'标记为未签入','Delete'=>'删除','Apply'=>'申请','All Statuses'=>'所有状态','Not Checked In'=>'未签入','Search by Name or Email'=>'按姓名或电子邮件搜索','Search'=>'搜索','Attendee'=>'出席者','Qty'=>'数量','Loading...'=>'正在加载...','Remove Icon'=>'删除图标','Add Icon'=>'添加图标','Select Icon'=>'选择图标','Icon/class name....'=>'图标/类名....','All Icon'=>'所有图标','Remove Image'=>'删除图像','Icon'=>'图标','Template Override'=>'模板覆盖','You do not have sufficient permissions to access this page.'=>'您没有足够的权限访问此页面。','Template Override System'=>'模板覆盖系统','Error loading template override settings.'=>'加载模板覆盖设置时出错。','Template Override Settings class not found. Please ensure the plugin is properly installed.'=>'找不到模板覆盖设置类。请确保插件已正确安装。','Addons'=>'插件','Support & Knowledge Base'=>'支持和知识库','F.A.Q'=>'常见问题解答','WooCommerce Event Manager'=>'WooCommerce 活动经理','WooCommerce Event Manager Plugin for WordPress is the complete event solution. All major functions are available in this plugin which is needed in an Event booking website.'=>'适用于 WordPress 的 WooCommerce 事件管理器插件是完整的事件解决方案。该插件提供所有主要功能，这是活动预订网站所需的。','It uses WooCommerce to take payment, which provides freedom for using popular payment getaway via WooCommerce. This plugin supports all WordPress version and can be used to create any types of any types of events.'=>'它使用 WooCommerce 进行付款，这为通过 WooCommerce 使用流行的付款方式提供了自由。该插件支持所有 WordPress 版本，可用于创建任何类型的任何类型的事件。','Buy Now'=>'立即购买','View Demo'=>'查看演示','Documentation'=>'文档','Pro Features You\'ll Love'=>'您会喜欢的专业功能','Attendee Management'=>'与会者管理','Attendee Custom Form'=>'与会者自定义表格','PDF Ticketing'=>'PDF 票务','Custom Emailing'=>'自定义电子邮件','Attendee Edit Feature'=>'与会者编辑功能','Attendee CSV Export'=>'与会者 CSV 导出','Report Overview'=>'报告概述','Custom Style Settings'=>'自定义样式设置','Translation Settings'=>'翻译设置','Available Addons'=>'可用插件','Extend your Event Manager with these powerful addons'=>'使用这些强大的插件扩展您的事件管理器','View Details'=>'查看详情','All Shortcode list'=>'所有简码列表','Frequently Asked Questions'=>'常见问题解答','Here is list of question that may help.'=>'这是可能有帮助的问题列表。','Get Pro and Others Available Addon to get all these exciting features'=>'获取专业版和其他可用插件以获得所有这些令人兴奋的功能','Global/Common Qty Addon'=>'全局/通用数量插件','Global Qty Addon is an excellent solution for managing qty as total available quantity. It\'s a smart idea that you don\'t want to manage qty as common qty from this addon useful.'=>'Global Qty Addon 是一个出色的解决方案，用于将数量管理为总可用数量。这是一个聪明的想法，您不想像管理此插件中的常见数量一样管理数量。','Event Max-Min Quantity Limiting Addon'=>'事件最大-最小数量限制插件','This event max-min addon is necessary for limiting the amount of tickets sold. Organizers can set a minimum buying quantity or minimum purchase quantity.'=>'此活动 max-min 插件对于限制售票量是必要的。主办方可以设置最低购买数量或最低购买数量。','Marketplace / Event Frontend Submit Addon'=>'市场/活动前端提交插件','This is a marketplace addon that is needed to allow event submit from frontend, multiple organizer can see ticket. Together in a same website.'=>'这是一个市场插件，需要允许从前端提交活动，多个组织者可以看到票证。一起在同一个网站上。','WooCommerce Event QR Code Addon'=>'WooCommerce 活动二维码插件','QR code addon is necessary for the ticket. If you have a large event then this addon must need to check ticket validity by scanning by QR scanner or mobile.'=>'门票需要二维码插件。如果您有大型活动，那么此插件必须需要通过 QR 扫描仪或手机扫描来检查门票的有效性。','WooCommerce Event Calendar Addon'=>'WooCommerce 活动日历插件','Event Calendar addon is nice addon that can list display in calendar view. Customer can easily understand event date.'=>'事件日历插件是一个不错的插件，可以在日历视图中列出显示。客户可以轻松了解活动日期。','WooCommerce Event: Book an Event From Dashboard'=>'WooCommerce 活动：从仪表板预订活动','This Addon is mainly used for admin, if anyone want to get order offline like phone order then after taking order admin can add attendee from dashboard.'=>'该插件主要用于管理员，如果有人想像电话订单一样离线订购，那么在接受订单后管理员可以从仪表板添加与会者。','Email Reminder Addon'=>'电子邮件提醒插件','This Addon is mainly used for addon, if anyone want to get order offline like phone order then after taking order admin can add attendee from dashboard.'=>'该插件主要用于插件，如果有人想像电话订单一样离线订购，那么在接受订单后管理员可以从仪表板添加与会者。','Early Bird Ticketing Discount Addon'=>'早鸟票折扣插件','Early bird addon is marketing addon, if someone wants to give discount based on date then this addon is very useful.'=>'早鸟插件是营销插件，如果有人想根据日期给予折扣，那么这个插件非常有用。','WooCommerce Event Waitlist Addon'=>'WooCommerce 活动候补名单插件','Waitlist addon is very useful, if any ticket become sold out organizer can get subscription for next available ticket.'=>'候补名单插件非常有用，如果任何门票售完，组织者可以订阅下一张可用门票。','Event Seat Plan Addon'=>'活动座位计划插件','A seat plan addon is needed for that organizer who wants to display a seat plan for customers to choose seat during event ticket buying. Seat plan needed for movie ticket, concert ticket booking.'=>'对于想要显示座位计划以供客户在购买活动门票时选择座位的组织者来说，需要一个座位计划插件。电影票、演唱会门票预订需要座位表。','Membership Price Addon'=>'会员价格插件','Membership pricing addon for the event is needed for that organizer who wants to offer different pricing based on the role. one of a wordpress website.'=>'对于想要根据角色提供不同定价的组织者来说，需要该活动的会员定价插件。 WordPress 网站之一。','WooCommerce Events: Duplicator Addon'=>'WooCommerce 活动：复制器插件','Duplication addon mainly needed to save time while event creating, if you have an existing event then just you can re-create event with all setting needed.'=>'复制插件主要需要在创建事件时节省时间，如果您有现有事件，那么您可以使用所需的所有设置重新创建事件。','WooCommerce Event Coupon Code Addon'=>'WooCommerce 活动优惠券代码插件','Event coupon addon that is used for marketing purpose and giving discount to customer for boosting sell.'=>'活动优惠券插件用于营销目的并向客户提供折扣以促进销售。','Review and Rating Addon'=>'评论和评级插件','It is a feature of adding addon designed to help added offering feedback from customers about their events.'=>'这是添加插件的一项功能，旨在帮助添加客户对其活动的反馈。','Mage WP Login Page Designer'=>'Mage WP 登录页面设计器','This plugin that will design a nice and login panel. It will look more professional than the wordpress default login panel.'=>'这个插件将设计一个漂亮的登录面板。它看起来比 WordPress 默认登录面板更专业。','Where can I find the Attendee registration Form?'=>'在哪里可以找到与会者登记表？','To enable attendee form you must first install a premium addon name “Form Builder”. Once you are done with installing – Click on “Events” -> Click on “All Events” -> Click on Edit of any existing event -> Scroll down below to find "Attendee Registration Form"'=>'要启用与会者表单，您必须首先安装一个高级插件名称“Form Builder”。安装完成后 – 单击“活动” -> 单击“所有活动” -> 单击编辑任何现有活动 -> 向下滚动以找到“与会者注册表”','How can I see event wise registered attendee list?'=>'我如何查看活动的注册与会者列表？',' If you visit attendee list menu in event section then you will see all attendee list here. You can filter choosing event name and date if event is recurring event.'=>' 如果您访问活动部分的与会者列表菜单，那么您将在此处看到所有与会者列表。如果事件是重复事件，您可以过滤选择事件名称和日期。','How can I Export attendee list as CSV?'=>'如何将与会者列表导出为 CSV？','If you visit attendee list menu in event section then you will see all attendee list here. You can filter choosing event name and date if event is recurring event. After filtering right section there is 2 button to export attendee and extra service.'=>'如果您访问活动部分的与会者列表菜单，那么您将在此处看到所有与会者列表。如果事件是重复事件，您可以过滤选择事件名称和日期。过滤右侧部分后，有 2 个按钮用于导出与会者和额外服务。','My plugin page shows 404 error?'=>'我的插件页面显示 404 错误？','Please re-save the permalink to solve the problem.'=>'请重新保存永久链接以解决问题。','Where Can I change Event Slug Url?'=>'在哪里可以更改事件 Slug URL？','In Event Settings area we have slug changing option. You can change it and resave permalink to avoid 404 error.'=>'在“事件设置”区域中，我们有“子弹更换”选项。您可以更改它并重新保存永久链接以避免 404 错误。','Where Can I configure Pdf Email?'=>'在哪里可以配置 PDF 电子邮件？','If you visit Event settings page then You will see PDF email tab top right, you can configure pdf email here.'=>'如果您访问活动设置页面，您将在右上角看到 PDF 电子邮件选项卡，您可以在此处配置 pdf 电子邮件。','I have configured correctly but pdf email I am not getting.'=>'我已正确配置，但我没有收到 pdf 电子邮件。','PDF email with pdf send based on some configuration. If order status processing or complete then only pdf email will send as we considered these 2 order status come after order payment done. If order status holds or pending, then email of pdf will not send.'=>'基于某些配置的 PDF 电子邮件和 pdf 发送。如果订单状态正在处理或完成，则只会发送 pdf 电子邮件，因为我们认为这 2 个订单状态是在订单付款完成后出现的。如果订单状态为保留或待处理，则不会发送 pdf 电子邮件。','Can I hide any section from event list and details page?'=>'我可以隐藏活动列表和详细信息页面中的任何部分吗？','Yes You can hide any section from event list and details page. If you go event settings area in general section, you will find lots of settings regarding all section.'=>'是的，您可以隐藏事件列表和详细信息页面中的任何部分。如果您进入常规部分的事件设置区域，您会发现有关所有部分的许多设置。','How Can I configure Virtual Event?'=>'如何配置虚拟活动？','For virtual event we know there should not have any location or physical address so we recommend to use template virtual that we have during event adding time and also you can use location hide settings from list and details page.'=>'对于虚拟事件，我们知道不应该有任何位置或物理地址，因此我们建议使用我们在事件添加期间拥有的虚拟模板，并且您也可以使用列表和详细信息页面中的位置隐藏设置。','I installed event manager plugin but it does not work?'=>'我安装了事件管理器插件但它不起作用？','Please install WooCommerce plugin first, before installing any plugin.'=>'在安装任何插件之前，请先安装 WooCommerce 插件。','Do you offer customization?'=>'你们提供定制服务吗？','Yes! we offer customization service for our client. If you want any new features don’t hesitate to contact us. Email: magepeopleteam@gmail.com.'=>'是的！我们为客户提供定制服务。如果您需要任何新功能，请随时与我们联系。电子邮件：magepeopleteam@gmail.com。','WooCommerce is already installed but not active. Click the button below to activate it right now.'=>'WooCommerce 已安装但未激活。单击下面的按钮立即激活它。','WooCommerce is required to process payments. We will securely download, install, and activate it for you right now.'=>'WooCommerce 需要处理付款。我们将立即为您安全地下载、安装并激活它。','Activate WooCommerce Now'=>'立即激活 WooCommerce','Install &amp; Activate Now'=>'安装&amp;立即激活','Set Up WooCommerce'=>'设置 WooCommerce','Activating WooCommerce...'=>'激活 WooCommerce...','Configuring settings...'=>'配置设置...','Finalizing setup...'=>'正在完成设置...','Downloading WooCommerce...'=>'正在下载 WooCommerce...','Installing WooCommerce...'=>'正在安装 WooCommerce...','Finalizing...'=>'正在敲定...','Successfully Activated! 100%'=>'激活成功！ 100%','Error: '=>'错误： ','A network error occurred. Please try again.'=>'发生网络错误。请再试一次。','Offline Payment'=>'线下支付','PayPal Configuration'=>'贝宝配置','Enable PayPal'=>'启用贝宝','Accept payments via PayPal'=>'通过 PayPal 接受付款','Sandbox / Test Mode'=>'沙盒/测试模式','Use sandbox credentials for testing'=>'使用沙盒凭据进行测试','API Credentials'=>'API 凭证','PayPal Client ID'=>'贝宝客户 ID','Enter your PayPal Client ID'=>'输入您的 PayPal 客户 ID','PayPal Secret Key'=>'贝宝密钥','Enter your PayPal Secret Key'=>'输入您的 PayPal 密钥','Save PayPal Settings'=>'保存贝宝设置','Stripe Configuration'=>'条带配置','Enable Stripe'=>'启用条纹','Accept payments via Stripe'=>'通过 Stripe 接受付款','Use test keys instead of live keys'=>'使用测试密钥而不是实时密钥','Test / Sandbox Keys'=>'测试/沙箱密钥','Test Publishable Key'=>'测试可发布密钥','Test Secret Key'=>'测试密钥','Live Keys'=>'实时按键','Live Publishable Key'=>'实时发布密钥','Live Secret Key'=>'实时密钥','Save Stripe Settings'=>'保存条纹设置','Offline Payment Configuration'=>'离线支付配置','Enable Offline Payment'=>'启用离线支付','Let customers pay offline (bank transfer, cash, pay at venue).'=>'让客户进行线下支付（银行转账、现金、现场支付）。','Payment Label'=>'付款标签','e.g. Pay at Venue / Bank Transfer'=>'例如现场付款/银行转账','This label is shown to customers on the frontend payment page.'=>'该标签在前端支付页面上向客户显示。','Save Offline Settings'=>'保存离线设置','Enabled'=>'启用','Disabled'=>'残疾人','Permission denied.'=>'没有权限。','Invalid gateway.'=>'网关无效。','Settings saved successfully!'=>'设置保存成功！','WooCommerce Payment Methods'=>'WooCommerce 付款方式','Additional Settings'=>'附加设置','Settings saved.'=>'设置已保存。','Installation failed. Please try manually.'=>'安装失败。请手动尝试。','WooCommerce activated successfully!'=>'WooCommerce 激活成功！','%s Settings'=>'%s 设置','General Settings'=>'常规设置','Event List Settings'=>'事件列表设置','Single Event Settings'=>'单一事件设置','Email Settings'=>'电子邮件设置','Style Settings'=>'风格设置','Icon Settings'=>'图标设置','Carousel Settings'=>'轮播设置','Slider Settings'=>'滑块设置','Payment'=>'付款方式','Currency'=>'货币','License'=>'许可证','Seat Reserved Order Status'=>'座位预订订单状态','Please select in which order status seat will mark as reserved/booked. By Default is Processing & Completed.'=>'请选择将在哪个订单状态中将座位标记为保留/已预订。默认情况下正在处理并已完成。','Block/Gutenberg Editor In Event'=>'活动中的区块/古腾堡编辑','By default, the Gutenberg editor is disabled. To enable the Gutenberg editor, you need to activate this option and also ensure that the REST API is enabled in the settings below.'=>'默认情况下，古腾堡编辑器处于禁用状态。要启用古腾堡编辑器，您需要激活此选项，并确保在下面的设置中启用 REST API。','Dashboard Event List Page Style'=>'仪表板事件列表页面样式','You can choose the Event List Page Design in Dasboard'=>'您可以在Dasboard中选择事件列表页面设计','Event Edit Page Mode'=>'事件编辑页面模式','Choose which editor opens by default when you add or edit an event.'=>'选择添加或编辑事件时默认打开的编辑器。','Modern'=>'现代','Classic'=>'经典','Enable Rest API?'=>'启用 Rest API？','If you want to enable event data available in the Rest API Please enable this.'=>'如果您想启用 Rest API 中可用的事件数据，请启用此功能。','Choose Multilingual Plugin'=>'选择多语言插件','Please select the name of your multilingual plugin from the list below.'=>'请从下面的列表中选择您的多语言插件的名称。','Event List Order By'=>'事件列表排序依据','Please select Event list order by which value Event Title or Event Date. By Default is: Event Upcoming Date'=>'请选择事件列表顺序，按事件标题或事件日期的值。默认为：活动即将举行的日期','Event Label'=>'事件标签','It will change the event post type label for the entire plugin.'=>'它将更改整个插件的事件帖子类型标签。','Event Slug'=>'事件蛞蝓','It will change the event slug throughout the entire plugin. Remember, after changing this slug you need to flush permalinks. Just go to <strong>Settings->Permalinks</strong> hit the Save Settings button'=>'它将更改整个插件中的事件 slug。请记住，更改此段后，您需要刷新永久链接。只需转到<strong>设置->永久链接</strong>点击保存设置按钮','Event Icon'=>'事件图标','Please enter the icon class name for the event custom post type. You can find icons here: Example: dashicons-calendar-alt. Find Icons: <a href="https://developer.wordpress.org/resource/dashicons/">Dashicons</a>'=>'请输入事件自定义帖子类型的图标类名称。您可以在此处找到图标：示例：dashicons-calendar-alt。查找图标：<a href="https://developer.wordpress.org/resource/dashicons/">Dashicons</a>','Event Category Label'=>'事件类别标签','This change will apply the event category label to the whole plugin.'=>'此更改会将事件类别标签应用于整个插件。','Event Category Slug'=>'事件类别蛞蝓','It will change the category slug for the entire plugin. Remember that after you change this slug, you need to flush permalinks. To do this, just go to <strong>Settings->Permalinks</strong> hit the Save Settings button.'=>'它将更改整个插件的类别 slug。请记住，更改此别名后，您需要刷新永久链接。为此，只需转到<strong>设置->永久链接</strong>点击保存设置按钮。','Event Organizer Label'=>'活动组织者标签','This will change the event organizer label throughout the plugin.'=>'这将更改整个插件的活动组织者标签。','Event Organizer Slug'=>'活动组织者 Slug','Changing the event organizer slug will have an effect on the entire plugin. Remember, after changing the slug, you will need to flush the permalinks. To do so, simply go to your settings page and select the flush permalinks option. <strong>Settings->Permalinks</strong> hit the Save Settings button.'=>'更改事件组织者 slug 将对整个插件产生影响。请记住，更改 slug 后，您将需要刷新永久链接。为此，只需转到设置页面并选择刷新永久链接选项即可。 <strong>设置->固定链接</strong>点击保存设置按钮。','Google Map Type'=>'谷歌地图类型','Please select the preferred map type you want to be displayed on the front page.<br><strong>Note:</strong> It"s been known that Iframe does not always show the precise location, whereas the API enabled map has a drag and drop feature for more accuracy. So if necessary, you can drag the point to the desired location.'=>'请选择您想要在首页显示的首选地图类型。<br><strong>注意：</strong>众所周知，Iframe 并不总是显示精确的位置，而支持 API 的地图具有拖放功能，可以提高准确性。因此，如果需要，您可以将点拖动到所需位置。','Google Map API Key'=>'谷歌地图 API 密钥','Enter Your Google Map API key. <a href=https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/get-api-key target=_blank>Get API Key</a>. <br><strong>Note:</strong> You must enter your billing address and information into the Google Maps API account to make it perfectly workable on your website.'=>'输入您的 Google 地图 API 密钥。 <a href=https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/get-api-key target=_blank>获取API密钥</a>。 <br><strong>注意：</strong> 您必须在 Google 地图 API 帐户中输入您的帐单地址和信息，才能使其在您的网站上完美运行。','Please select when the event will end'=>'请选择活动结束时间','Hide old date from date picker'=>'从日期选择器中隐藏旧日期','If you would like to hide the location details from the order details section on the thank you page and confirmation email body, please choose "Yes". If you would like to show the location details, please choose "No". The default setting is "No".'=>'如果您想在感谢页面和确认电子邮件正文的订单详细信息部分隐藏位置详细信息，请选择“是”。如果您想显示位置详细信息，请选择“否”。默认设置为“否”。','Hide expire ticket type'=>'隐藏过期票证类型','Hide Location From Order Details & Email Section'=>'从订单详细信息和电子邮件部分隐藏位置','Hide Date From Order Details & Email Section'=>'隐藏订单详细信息和电子邮件部分的日期','This toggle determines whether or not the date is shown in the order details section of the thank you page and confirmation email body. Choose "Yes" to hide the date or "No" to show it. The default is "No".'=>'此切换开关确定日期是否显示在感谢页面和确认电子邮件正文的订单详细信息部分中。选择“是”隐藏日期或选择“否”显示日期。默认为“否”。','Hide Expired Event from Calendar'=>'从日历中隐藏过期事件','If you want to hide the expired event from the calendar please select Yes. Its applicable for the Free Calendar'=>'如果您想从日历中隐藏过期的活动，请选择是。适用于免费日历','Redirect Checkout after Booking'=>'预订后重定向结账','This setting controls whether or not the checkout page is redirected after booking an event.'=>'此设置控制预订活动后是否重定向结账页面。','Show 0 Price as Free'=>'显示 0 价格为免费','This setting enables you to a "Free" at a price of 0. By default, this setting is enabled.'=>'此设置使您能够以 0 的价格“免费”。默认情况下，此设置处于启用状态。','Event Ticket Expire before minutes'=>'活动门票几分钟前到期','Please enter the number of minutes before the event that an attendee cannot book/register a ticket.'=>'请输入活动开始前与会者无法预订/登记门票的分钟数。','Event Expire Time on Cart'=>'购物车上的活动过期时间','Please enter the number of minutes after that the event will removed from the cart'=>'请输入该活动将从购物车中删除后的分钟数','Load Font Awesome From Theme?'=>'从主题加载很棒的字体？','If the icons are not working and you want to disable Font Awesome loading from the plugin, select Yes.'=>'如果图标不起作用并且您想要禁用从插件加载 Font Awesome，请选择是。','Load Flat Icon From Theme?'=>'从主题加载平面图标？','If the icons are not working, and you want to remove Flat Icon load from the plugin, select "Yes."'=>'如果图标不起作用，并且您想从插件中删除平面图标加载，请选择“是”。','Speed up the Event List Page Loading?'=>'加快事件列表页面加载速度？','If your event list page is loading slowly, you can select this option to improve performance. Keep in mind that selecting this option will disable Waitlist and Seat count features. '=>'如果您的事件列表页面加载缓慢，您可以选择此选项来提高性能。请记住，选择此选项将禁用等候名单和座位计数功能。 ','Disappear Event from list when fully booked?'=>'订满后从列表中消失活动吗？','If you want your event to be removed from the list once it is fully booked, you can select "Yes" here.'=>'如果您希望在活动预订满后将其从列表中删除，您可以在此处选择“是”。','Show Sold out Ribon?'=>'显示 丝带已售完？','You can show a "Sold Out" Ribbon on the event list when it is fully booked by selecting "Yes" here.'=>'当活动预订满时，您可以在此处选择“是”，在活动列表上显示“售完”功能区。','Show Limited Availability Ribbon?'=>'显示有限可用性功能区？','Display a "Limited Availability" ribbon when tickets are running low but not sold out yet.'=>'当门票数量不足但尚未售完时，会显示“限量供应”功能区。','Limited Availability Threshold'=>'有限的可用性阈值','Show "Limited Availability" ribbon when available seats are less than or equal to this number.'=>'当可用座位数小于或等于此数量时，显示“有限可用”功能区。','Limited Availability Ribbon Text'=>'可用性有限的功能区文本','The text to display on the limited availability ribbon.'=>'显示在有限可用性功能区上的文本。','Show Low Stock Warning?'=>'显示库存不足警告？','Enable this to show a warning message when event seats are running low.'=>'启用此选项可在活动席位不足时显示警告消息。','Low Stock Threshold'=>'库存门槛低','Show low stock warning when available seats are less than or equal to this number.'=>'当可用座位数小于或等于此数字时，显示库存不足警告。','Low Stock Warning Text'=>'库存不足警告文本','The text to display when seats are running low.'=>'当座位不足时显示的文本。','Send Low Stock Email Notifications?'=>'发送库存不足电子邮件通知？','Enable this to send email notifications to admin when event seats are running low.'=>'启用此选项可在活动席位不足时向管理员发送电子邮件通知。','Show Hidden Woocommerce Products?'=>'显示隐藏的 Woocommerce 产品？','With every creation of an event there is a Woocommerce product is also created. By default its hidden in the Product list. If you want to show them in the list select Yes'=>'每次创建活动时都会创建一个 Woocommerce 产品。默认情况下，它隐藏在产品列表中。如果您想在列表中显示它们，请选择是','Set the Google Map Zoom Level'=>'设置 Google 地图缩放级别','Select the Google Map zoom level. By default is 17'=>'选择 Google 地图缩放级别。默认为 17','Show Event Sidebar Widgets?'=>'显示事件侧边栏小部件？','If you enable this then a Widget area will be registred and you can add any widgets from the Widget Menu. By default its disabled'=>'如果启用此功能，则将注册小部件区域，并且您可以从小部件菜单添加任何小部件。默认情况下禁用','Clear Cart after Checkout Order Placed?'=>'结帐订单后清除购物车？','By default we clear the cart after order placed, But some payment gateway need cart data after order placed. If you get any warning after order placed please disabled this and try again. Unless please do not change this settings.'=>'默认情况下，我们在下单后清除购物车，但有些支付网关在下单后需要购物车数据。如果您在下订单后收到任何警告，请禁用此功能并重试。除非请不要更改此设置。','Manual Seat Left Fixing?'=>'手动座椅左侧固定？','If you encounter the message "Sorry, There Are No Seats Available" after updating to version 4.3.0 or later, you may enable this setting. Otherwise, please keep it unchanged.'=>'如果您在更新到4.3.0或更高版本后遇到“抱歉，没有可用座位”的消息，您可以启用此设置。否则，请保持不变。','Event Details Page Fatal Error Fix?'=>'活动详细信息页面致命错误修复了吗？','If you encounter a Fatal Error message on the event details page, you can enable this patch and check if the error persists. However, if there is no error, we recommend keeping the patch disabled'=>'如果您在事件详细信息页面上遇到致命错误消息，您可以启用此补丁并检查错误是否仍然存在。但是，如果没有错误，我们建议保持补丁禁用','Date Picker Format'=>'日期选择器格式','If you want to change Date Picker Format, please select format. Default is yy-mm-dd. <b>Text Based Date format will not works in other language except english. Is your website is not English language please do not use any text based datepicker.</b>'=>'如果您想更改日期选择器格式，请选择格式。默认为年-月-日。 <b>基于文本的日期格式不适用于除英语之外的其他语言。如果您的网站不是英语，请不要使用任何基于文本的日期选择器。</b>','On/Off Event Price in List'=>'列表中的开/关活动价格','This enables or disables the event price in the list. By default, it is enabled.'=>'这将启用或禁用列表中的事件价格。默认情况下，它是启用的。','On/Off Multi Date List in Event listing Page'=>'事件列表页面中的开/关多日期列表','This feature enables or disables the full date list for multi-date events in the event listing page. By default, this feature is enabled.'=>'此功能在事件列表页面中启用或禁用多日期事件的完整日期列表。默认情况下，此功能处于启用状态。','Hide Organizer Section from list'=>'从列表中隐藏组织者部分','Please select "Yes" to hide or "No" to display.'=>'请选择“是”隐藏或选择“否”显示。','Hide Location Section from list'=>'从列表中隐藏位置部分','Hide Full Time Section from list'=>'从列表中隐藏全职部分','Hide Only End Time Section from list'=>'仅隐藏列表中的结束时间部分','Hide/Show Event Hover Book Now Button'=>'隐藏/显示活动悬停立即预订按钮','Please select either \'Yes\' to hide or \'No\' to display.'=>'请选择“是”隐藏或“否”显示。','Hide/Show Event list Massage'=>'隐藏/显示事件列表 按摩','On/Off Product Category in Event'=>'活动中的开/关产品类别','Enabling this feature will allow you to assign a product category to the event edit page. If you have a product category-based coupon code that you want to use, you have to assign the event to the same product category. In order to enable this feature, please select \'Yes\'.'=>'启用此功能将允许您将产品类别分配到事件编辑页面。如果您想要使用基于产品类别的优惠券代码，则必须将该活动分配给相同的产品类别。为了启用此功能，请选择“是”。','Single Event Page Template'=>'单个事件页面模板','This change will impact the template for the single event details page.'=>'此更改将影响单个事件详细信息页面的模板。','On/Off Shipping Method on event'=>'活动上/下运输方式','The event product type in WooCommerce is set to virtual by default. If you change this type, you will need to save all of your events again.'=>'WooCommerce 中的事件产品类型默认设置为虚拟。如果更改此类型，您将需要再次保存所有事件。','Hide Event Date Section from Single Event Details page'=>'隐藏单个事件详细信息页面中的事件日期部分','Hide Event Time Section from Single Event Details page'=>'隐藏单个事件详细信息页面中的事件时间部分','Hide Event Location Section from Single Event Details page'=>'隐藏单个事件详细信息页面中的事件位置部分','Hide Event Total Seats Section from Single Event Details page'=>'隐藏单个活动详细信息页面中的活动总座位数部分','Hide "Org By" Section from Single Event Details page'=>'隐藏单个事件详细信息页面中的“组织依据”部分','Hide Event Address Section from Single Event Details page'=>'隐藏单个事件详细信息页面中的事件地址部分','Hide Event Schedule Section from Single Event Details page'=>'隐藏单个活动详细信息页面中的活动日程部分','Hide Event Share this Section from Single Event Details page'=>'隐藏活动 从单个活动详细信息页面共享此部分','Hide Add Calendar Button from Single Event Details page'=>'从单个事件详细信息页面隐藏添加日历按钮','Hide Description Title'=>'隐藏描述标题','Hide Left Sidebar Title'=>'隐藏左侧边栏标题','Hide Display Event Time Below Title'=>'隐藏标题下方的显示事件时间','Email Sent on order status'=>'关于订单状态的电子邮件发送','Please select when you would like the customer to receive an email confirming their order status event.'=>'请选择您希望客户何时收到确认其订单状态事件的电子邮件。','Email From Name'=>'电子邮件发件人姓名','From Email'=>'来自电子邮件','Email Subject'=>'电子邮件主题','Confirmation Email Text'=>'确认电子邮件文本','Send Confirmation Email to Billing Email Address'=>'发送确认电子邮件至帐单电子邮件地址','By default Plugin sent the Event Confirmation Email to the Billing Email Address. If you want to turn off this you can disbale this setting.'=>'默认情况下，插件将事件确认电子邮件发送到帐单电子邮件地址。如果您想关闭此功能，可以禁用此设置。','Primary Color'=>'原色','Choose a basic color, it will change the icon background color & border color.'=>'选择一个基本颜色，它将改变图标背景颜色和边框颜色。','Secondary Color'=>'次要颜色','Choose a basic text color, it will change the text color.'=>'选择一个基本的文本颜色，它会改变文本颜色。','Choose Event Date Icon'=>'选择事件日期图标','Please choose event date icon.'=>'请选择活动日期图标。','Choose Event Time Icon'=>'选择事件时间图标','Please choose event time icon.'=>'请选择活动时间图标。','Choose Event Location Icon'=>'选择活动地点图标','Please choose event location icon.'=>'请选择活动地点图标。','Choose Event Organizer Icon'=>'选择活动组织者图标','Please choose event organizer icon.'=>'请选择活动组织者图标。','Choose Event Sidebar Location List Icon'=>'选择事件侧边栏位置列表图标','Please choose event sidebar location list icon.'=>'请选择活动侧边栏位置列表图标。','Choose Event Social Share Icon for Facebook'=>'选择 Facebook 的事件社交分享图标','Please choose event social share icon for facebook.'=>'请选择 Facebook 的活动社交分享图标。','Choose Event Social Share Icon for Twitter'=>'选择 Twitter 的事件社交分享图标','Please choose event social share icon for twitter.'=>'请选择 Twitter 的活动社交分享图标。','Choose Event Social Share Icon for Linkedin'=>'选择 Linkedin 的事件社交分享图标','Please choose event social share icon for linkedin.'=>'请选择 linkedin 的活动社交分享图标。','Choose Event Social Share Icon for Whatsapp'=>'选择 Whatsapp 的事件社交分享图标','Please choose event social share icon for whatsapp.'=>'请选择 Whatsapp 的活动社交分享图标。','Choose Event Social Share Icon for Email'=>'选择电子邮件的事件社交分享图标','Please choose event social share icon for email.'=>'请选择电子邮件的活动社交分享图标。','Load Owl Carousel From Theme'=>'从主题加载猫头鹰旋转木马','Select "Yes" only if your theme already includes Owl Carousel library. Select "No" (recommended) to let the plugin load its own Owl Carousel library. If carousel is not working, ensure this is set to "No".'=>'仅当您的主题已包含 Owl Carousel 库时，才选择“是”。选择“否”（推荐）让插件加载自己的 Owl Carousel 库。如果轮播不起作用，请确保将其设置为“否”。','No - Load from Plugin (Recommended)'=>'否 - 从插件加载（推荐）','Yes - Load from Theme'=>'是 - 从主题加载','Auto Play'=>'自动播放','Please select Carousel will auto play or not.'=>'请选择轮播是否自动播放。','Infinite Loop'=>'无限循环','Please select Carousel will Infinite Loop or not.'=>'请选择轮播是否无限循环。','Carousel Auto Play Speed'=>'轮播自动播放速度','Please Enter Carousel Auto Play Speed. Default is 5000'=>'请输入轮播自动播放速度。默认值为 5000','Slider Type'=>'滑块型','Please Select Slider Type Default Slider'=>'请选择滑块类型 默认滑块','Slider'=>'滑块','Post Thumbnail'=>'帖子缩略图','Slider Style'=>'滑块样式','Please Select Slider Style Default Style One'=>'请选择滑块样式 默认样式一','Style One'=>'风格一','Style Two'=>'风格二','Slider Indicator Visible?'=>'滑块指示器可见？','Please Select Slider Indicator Visible or Not? Default ON'=>'请选择滑块指示器是否可见？默认开启','ON'=>'开','Off'=>'关闭','Slider Indicator Type'=>'滑块指示器类型','Please Select Slider Indicator Type Default Icon'=>'请选择滑块指示器类型默认图标','Icon Indicator'=>'图标指示器','image Indicator'=>'图像指示器','Slider Showcase Visible?'=>'滑块展示可见？','Please Select Slider Showcase Visible or Not? Default ON'=>'请选择滑块展示是否可见？默认开启','Slider Showcase Position'=>'滑块展示位置','Please Select Slider Showcase Position Default Right'=>'请选择滑块展示位置默认右侧','At Top Position'=>'处于最高位置','At Right Position'=>'在正确的位置','At Bottom Position'=>'位于底部位置','At Left Position'=>'在左侧位置','Slider Popup Image Indicator'=>'滑块弹出图像指示器','Please Select Slider Popup Indicator Image ON or Off? Default ON'=>'请选择滑块弹出指示器图像打开还是关闭？默认开启','Slider Popup Icon Indicator'=>'滑块弹出图标指示器','Please Select Slider Popup Indicator Icon ON or Off? Default ON'=>'请选择滑块弹出指示器图标打开还是关闭？默认开启','Slider height'=>'滑块高度','Please Select Slider Height'=>'请选择滑块高度','Minimum'=>'最低','Average'=>'平均','Maximum'=>'最大','Install & Activate Now'=>'立即安装并激活','WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce','Custom Payment'=>'定制支付','Notice: WooCommerce is Not Activated'=>'注意：WooCommerce 未激活','To actually use the "Ticket-Selling" event type and allow ticket sales, you must install and activate WooCommerce.'=>'要实际使用“售票”活动类型并允许售票，您必须安装并激活 WooCommerce。','Enable WooCommerce Payment'=>'启用 WooCommerce 付款','If enabled, WooCommerce payment gateway will be used for checkout.'=>'如果启用，WooCommerce 支付网关将用于结帐。','After Adding to Cart, Redirect to'=>'添加到购物车后，重定向到','Select where to redirect after adding tickets to cart.'=>'选择将门票添加到购物车后重定向到的位置。','Cart'=>'购物车','Checkout'=>'结账','After Confirming the Order, Redirect To'=>'确认订单后，重定向至','Select where to redirect after confirming the order.'=>'确认订单后选择重定向目的地。','Plugin Thank You Page'=>'插件感谢页面','WooCommerce Thank You Page'=>'WooCommerce 感谢页面','Require Account Login'=>'需要帐户登录','Require login to purchase event tickets.'=>'需要登录才能购买活动门票。','Show Billing Info'=>'显示帐单信息','Show billing info on WooCommerce checkout page.'=>'在 WooCommerce 结账页面上显示账单信息。','Confirm Ticket Based on Payment Status'=>'根据付款状态确认门票','Select the payment statuses that will trigger ticket confirmation.'=>'选择将触发票据确认的付款状态。','Pending payment'=>'待付款','Processing'=>'加工','On hold'=>'暂停','Completed'=>'已完成','PayPal'=>'贝宝','Configure'=>'配置','Available in Pro version'=>'提供专业版','Stripe'=>'条纹','Booking Confirmation Page'=>'预订确认页面','Select a page with the [mep_booking_confirmation] shortcode. After booking, customers are redirected here instead of back to the event page.'=>'选择带有 [mep_booking_confirmation] 短代码的页面。预订后，客户将被重定向至此处，而不是返回活动页面。','— Default —'=>'— 默认 —','WooCommerce is active'=>'WooCommerce 处于活动状态','Currency display is controlled by WooCommerce settings. The settings below are used as a fallback when WooCommerce is deactivated.'=>'货币显示由 WooCommerce 设置控制。以下设置用作停用 WooCommerce 时的后备设置。','WooCommerce is not active'=>'WooCommerce 未激活','These currency settings are used for price display and the native checkout flow.'=>'这些货币设置用于价格显示和本机结帐流程。','Currency Symbol'=>'货币符号','The symbol to display next to prices (e.g. $, €, £, ৳).'=>'显示在价格旁边的符号（例如 $、€、£、৳）。','Currency Position'=>'货币头寸','Where the symbol appears relative to the price.'=>'符号相对于价格出现的位置。','Left — $99'=>'左 — 99 美元','Right — 99$'=>'右 — 99 美元','Left with space — $ 99'=>'剩余空间 — 99 美元','Right with space — 99 $'=>'空间充足 — 99 美元','Decimal Separator'=>'小数点分隔符','Character used as the decimal separator (e.g. . or ,).'=>'用作小数点分隔符的字符（例如 . 或 ,）。','Thousands Separator'=>'千位分隔符','Character used as the thousands separato