tings'=>'您可以通过进入设置来更改活动门票角色','Select User Role'=>'选择用户角色','For Any Logged in user'=>'对于任何登录用户','You can select event ticket role by going to the settings'=>'您可以通过进入设置来选择活动门票角色','Successfully Booking Reset '=>'成功预订重置 ','Booking Reset unsuccessful'=>'预订重置失败','FAQ Settings'=>'常见问题设置','FAQ Settings will be here.'=>'常见问题解答设置将在这里。','FAQ Off/On'=>'常见问题解答 关/开','FAQ Description'=>'常见问题说明','Content'=>'内容','Edit F.A.Q Info : '=>'编辑常见问题解答信息： ','Add New F.A.Q Info'=>'添加新的常见问题解答信息','Related Event Settings'=>'相关事件设置','Related Event setup.'=>'相关事件设置。','Related Event'=>'相关活动','Show Related Events'=>'显示相关活动','Show/hide releated events in frontend template'=>'在前端模板中显示/隐藏相关事件','Related Events Section Label'=>'相关事件部分标签','Add a title above the releated events'=>'在相关事件上方添加标题','Event List'=>'活动列表','Search and select related events'=>'搜索并选择相关事件','Search events...'=>'搜索事件...','No related events selected.'=>'没有选择相关事件。','No events found. Try a different search term.'=>'未找到任何事件。尝试不同的搜索词。','Rich Texts for SEO & Google Schema Text'=>'用于 SEO 和 Google Schema 文本的富文本','Configure Your Settings Here'=>'在此配置您的设置','Tax Settings'=>'税务设置','Configure Event Tax'=>'配置事件税','Rich Text Status'=>'富文本状态','Enable'=>'启用','Disable'=>'禁用','Type :'=>'类型：','Name :'=>'姓名：','Start Date :'=>'开始日期：','End Date :'=>'结束日期：','Event Status:'=>'活动状态：','Event Rescheduled'=>'活动重新安排','Event Moved Online'=>'活动移至线上','Event Postponed'=>'活动推迟','Event Cancelled'=>'活动取消','Event Attendance Mode:'=>'活动出席方式：','OfflineEventAttendanceMode'=>'离线活动出席模式','OnlineEventAttendanceMode'=>'在线活动出席方式','MixedEventAttendanceMode'=>'混合活动出勤模式','Previous Start Date:'=>'上次开始日期：','Check Rich Text Status'=>'检查富文本状态','Events'=>'活动','Tax'=>'税','SEO Content'=>'搜索引擎优化内容','Template'=>'模板','Related Events'=>'相关活动','Timeline Details'=>'时间表详细信息','Gallery'=>'画廊','Gallery '=>'画廊 ','By default slider is ON but you can keep it off by switching this option'=>'默认情况下滑块处于打开状态，但您可以通过切换此选项将其关闭','Please upload images for gallery'=>'请上传图库的图片','Here gallery image can be added  to ev